---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Global Spellbound Initiative | Community Pride Starts with Children"
  description="Opening a world of opportunity through words. GSI is preparing literacy, education and youth leadership programs for children and families in the DMV."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-orbit hero-orbit-one"></div>
    <div class="hero-orbit hero-orbit-two"></div>
    <div class="shell hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Literacy · Learning · Leadership</p>
      <h1>Opening a World of Opportunity <span>Through Words.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">
        Global Spellbound Initiative brings families, educators and communities together to help
        children strengthen literacy, grow in confidence and develop as leaders.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-gold" href="/programs/#interest">Join Our Interest List</a>
        <a class="button button-outline-light" href="/get-involved/">Partner With Us</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note">
        <span class="status-dot"></span>
        <span><strong>Coming Soon to the DMV</strong><br />Washington, DC · Maryland · Virginia</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-book" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="book-globe">G</div>
      <div class="book-pages"></div>
      <span>LEARN · LEAD · GROW</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-warm">
    <div class="shell intro-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Who We Are</p>
        <h2>Community Pride Starts with Children.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="lead">
          Global Spellbound Initiative (GSI) is a Virginia-based, IRS-recognized 501(c)(3)
          nonprofit, tax-exempt organization dedicated to literacy, education and youth leadership.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are building community-centered educational opportunities around a simple belief:
          when children discover the power of words, they gain tools to express themselves, pursue
          learning and contribute to their communities.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/about/">Get to know GSI <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">What We're Building</p>
        <h2>Learning that helps young people find their voice.</h2>
        <p>Planned programs connect literacy with encouragement, mentorship and opportunity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-cards">
        <article class="program-card">
          <span class="card-number">01</span>
          <h3>Spelling, Reading &amp; Vocabulary</h3>
          <p>Engaging activities that help children explore language and communicate with confidence.</p>
          <span class="status-label">Planned</span>
        </article>
        <article class="program-card">
          <span class="card-number">02</span>
          <h3>Tutoring &amp; Mentoring</h3>
          <p>Supportive learning relationships connecting children with educators and community volunteers.</p>
          <span class="status-label">Planned</span>
        </article>
        <article class="program-card">
          <span class="card-number">03</span>
          <h3>Youth Leadership</h3>
          <p>Opportunities to practice public speaking, teamwork and community participation.</p>
          <span class="status-label">Planned</span>
        </article>
        <article class="program-card">
          <span class="card-number">04</span>
          <h3>Educational Pathways</h3>
          <p>Information and guidance to help families explore future learning opportunities.</p>
          <span class="status-label">Planned</span>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="center-action">
        <a class="button button-outline" href="/programs/">Explore Our Programs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-navy">
    <div class="shell feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/logo.jpeg" alt="" width="360" height="360" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="feature-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Featured Initiative</p>
        <h2>Introducing the Ethiopian American Spelling Bee.</h2>
        <p>
          GSI is preparing a community-based spelling and literacy initiative for families in
          Washington, DC, Maryland and Virginia. The proposed program combines spelling,
          vocabulary, reading and speaking activities, bringing children and families together
          through local community hosts.
        </p>
        <a class="button button-gold" href="/programs/#interest">Join Our Interest List</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-warm">
    <div class="shell founder-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Experience Behind the Mission</p>
        <h2>Built on a commitment to children's learning.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          GSI's founder, Abiye Tekle, brings experience from tutoring and mentoring at DSKM Church
          in Washington, DC, and from founding Ethiopian Spelling Bee. These experiences inform
          GSI's approach to community learning and educational opportunity.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/about/">Read our story <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-cta">
    <div class="shell cta-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Be Part of What's Next</p>
      <h2>Help the next generation find its voice.</h2>
      <p>Families, educators, volunteers, community leaders and businesses all have a place in this mission.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-gold" href="/programs/#interest">For Families</a>
        <a class="button button-outline-light" href="/get-involved/">Volunteer, Host or Partner</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
